# Defense-in-depth only: this folder (backend/) should NEVER be the Apache
# document root — it holds config/, migrations/, scripts/, and .env
# alongside the app code. Point your XAMPP vhost's DocumentRoot at
# backend/public instead (see backend/scripts/README-serving.md). If this
# rule is actually taking effect for you, fix the DocumentRoot rather than
# removing this file.
Require all denied
